<title>USA: NY/NJ Port Authority goahead for DHL.</title>
<headline>NY/NJ Port Authority goahead for DHL.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Feb 11, (REUTERS)  The Port Authority of New York and New Jersey said it approved a lease for DHL Airways</p>
<p>The lease agreement covers approximately 23,600 square feet of warehouse and about 16,500 square feet of related outside space. It begins May 1.</p>
<p>The authority said DHL agreed to renovate and improve the site at a cost of about $750,000 by about September 1. --Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax +5017</p>
